## COMMUNICATION
A sort of MOF-based microcapsules with novel bowl-liked structures has been synthesized through a competitive coordination strategy. Owing to the unique structure and composition of these nano-structures, the prepared microcapsules exhibit excellent performance and stability in adsorbing and removing iodine for both vapor and solution.
